1
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:51,952
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,330 --> 00:00:54,192
(This story is fictional.)

3
00:00:54,192 --> 00:00:55,792
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,912
=Episode 15=

5
00:01:02,439 --> 00:01:02,840
Boss.

6
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,040
Why haven't we heard from Mona yet?

7
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:07,840
Wait a little longer.

8
00:01:09,239 --> 00:01:10,760
She'll let us know
if she finds anything.

9
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,280
(Mian.)

10
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:21,840
(You finally answered.)

11
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:26,239
How come it's you?

12
00:01:27,799 --> 00:01:28,439
Where's Mona?

13
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:30,200
(Don't worry.)

14
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,719
(Your cop girlfriend)

15
00:01:33,079 --> 00:01:33,560
(is just fine.)

16
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,760
(If you don't believe me, look up.)

17
00:01:36,879 --> 00:01:37,280
Bring her over.

18
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,879
What do you want?

19
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:55,000
Find Tai's body and bring it to me.

20
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:58,719
Then I'll release her.

21
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:06,519
Boss.

22
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:07,760
What now?

23
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:10,280
Save her first.

24
00:02:23,479 --> 00:02:23,879
Suowen.

25
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,400
I brought the heart you wanted.

26
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:29,800
Open it.

27
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:31,639
I need to check

28
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:33,159
if that's Tai.

29
00:02:42,639 --> 00:02:43,639
Give me his heart.

30
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,000
Release her first.

31
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:50,879
You get her.

32
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,800
I get his heart.

33
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,719
Get it to the OR!

34
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,479
Prep for surgery!

35
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:21,479
How come it's you?

36
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,280
You exposed Mona's identity.

37
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:34,840
Meeting Ma Ding wasn't by chance, right?

38
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,680
Suowen sent you, didn't he?

39
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,199
Boss, what's going on?

40
00:03:40,319 --> 00:03:41,120
I'm asking her.

41
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,039
I haven't even asked you yet.

42
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,919
How did you survive back then?

43
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:55,240
Zhou Yan, I'm sorry.

44
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,759
I told them where Mona was.

45
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:03,159
But I was forced.

46
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:06,879
Mr. Natuo.

47
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,439
The guy from Huaguo got away.

48
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:09,599
Useless!

49
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,919
You're all useless!

50
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,759
See if she's dead.

51
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:23,319
If not, send her to Wu Suowen.

52
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:28,959
Natuo...

53
00:04:28,959 --> 00:04:30,759
Natuo sent me to Suowen
as a body packer.

54
00:04:31,839 --> 00:04:33,720
They used different drugs to control us.

55
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,560
I really didn't mean to, Zhou Yan.

56
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:37,920
I'm sorry.

57
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:39,759
You're still lying to me?

58
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,120
Boss.

59
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,199
She was forced too.

60
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,279
Let's find Mona first, okay?

61
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:52,199
Boss.

62
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,879
We've searched everywhere.

63
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,120
No sign of Mona.

64
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,480
You know where Mona is, don't you?

65
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,319
Tell me.

66
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,519
I will.

67
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,600
But only you.

68
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:36,680
Where's Mona?

69
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,079
Zhou Yan.

70
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,959
You know I like you.

71
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,560
You think I'm not good enough for you?

72
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,600
You brought me here for this?

73
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:50,759
What if I told you...

74
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,120
I'm about to die?

75
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,319
Would you save me again?

76
00:05:56,319 --> 00:05:57,319
You lied once.

77
00:05:57,319 --> 00:05:58,759
Then lied again.

78
00:05:58,759 --> 00:05:59,920
Whatever your reason,

79
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,720
we don't even know if Mona's alive.

80
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,800
So you have to tell me right now

81
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,839
where she is.

82
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,720
If it were between Mona and me,

83
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,720
and only one of us could survive...

84
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,959
But you're still alive!

85
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:37,959
Look at me!

86
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:40,439
Where is she?

87
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:47,879
If it were between Mona and me,

88
00:06:48,959 --> 00:06:50,040
and only one of us could survive,

89
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,199
who would you save?

90
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:06,879
Tell me.

91
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,680
Where is she?

92
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,680
I'll tell you.

93
00:07:17,639 --> 00:07:19,480
She's in the pool
at the hospital rehab center.

94
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,399
Zhou Yan.

95
00:07:55,959 --> 00:07:57,040
I really owe you for this.

96
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:59,639
I'd be dead without you.

97
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,680
You don't have to thank me.

98
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,560
All this time in Langia,

99
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,920
you've saved me so many times.

100
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:06,680
I'd be dead without you.

101
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,199
It's too dangerous.

102
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,959
Leave as soon as you're well enough.

103
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:15,120
What about you?

104
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,600
By now,

105
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,759
Suowen should be in the OR.

106
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:23,639
I'll make him pay

107
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,519
for everything.

108
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:43,639
The surgery's over?

109
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:45,720
Well.

110
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:46,919
You're awake.

111
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:48,120
Boss Suowen.

112
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:55,320
How come it's you?

113
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,440
What's wrong?

114
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:57,960
Surprised to see me?

115
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:00,600
I still remember it clearly.

116
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,919
The first time we met,

117
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,480
I was lying on
this very operating table.

118
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:09,360
You finally got the heart
you searched so long for.

119
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:12,519
Don't you want to see
what it looks like?

120
00:09:12,879 --> 00:09:13,279
You...

121
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:14,879
What are you going to do?

122
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,919
You're black-hearted.

123
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,519
Only a rotten, black, stinking pig heart

124
00:09:22,559 --> 00:09:24,080
would suit you.

125
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,320
Now you're scared?

126
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,360
On this table,

127
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,639
you harvested so many people's organs.

128
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:40,759
Did you ever think

129
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:42,440
you'd end up on this table someday?

130
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,000
I'm begging you!

131
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:46,399
I'm begging you!

132
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,000
When I begged you,

133
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,000
you showed no mercy.

134
00:09:51,759 --> 00:09:52,600
But I promised

135
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,600
I'd give you this heart.

136
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:56,600
How about this?

137
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,799
Trade your other organs for it.

138
00:09:59,399 --> 00:09:59,879
No!

139
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:01,120
No!

140
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:03,039
No!

141
00:10:03,639 --> 00:10:04,240
No!

142
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:04,919
Go.

143
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,919
Cut out his organs.

144
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:12,519
You're good at that, aren't you?

145
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:18,039
Go on.

146
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:20,240
Please.

147
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:22,759
Oh, right.

148
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:24,480
I'm kinder than you.

149
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,159
I gave you anesthesia.

150
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:27,559
It won't hurt.

151
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,720
No!

152
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:31,600
No!

153
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:36,399
No!

154
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,399
Where should we start?

155
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,600
Quite the appetite he's got.

156
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,159
Let's start with his stomach.

157
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:48,159
No!

158
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,600
Please, don't!

159
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,120
No!

160
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,320
No!

161
00:11:01,399 --> 00:11:02,200
The stomach's out.

162
00:11:02,919 --> 00:11:03,720
What's next?

163
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,799
He's heartless.

164
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:07,720
Take out his lungs.

165
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,360
Throw them to the dogs.

166
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:13,919
No!

167
00:11:17,919 --> 00:11:18,519
No!

168
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:19,960
No!

169
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:24,799
The lungs are out.

170
00:11:31,639 --> 00:11:32,360
He passed out.

171
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,399
That heart can't take much.

172
00:11:38,519 --> 00:11:39,639
What a shame.

173
00:11:39,639 --> 00:11:40,879
Everything's still so fresh.

174
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:43,600
They'd make great pork offal porridge.

175
00:11:44,679 --> 00:11:45,000
Boss!

176
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,279
Natuo and his men have broken in!

177
00:11:46,519 --> 00:11:47,159
We have to go now!

178
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,360
Perfect timing.

179
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,159
Leave him to Natuo.

180
00:12:09,279 --> 00:12:10,360
Could this be

181
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,159
Suowen?

182
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:13,840
Trying to

183
00:12:14,639 --> 00:12:16,080
get yourself a new heart?

184
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,039
Dream on.

185
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:47,039
Take every file.

186
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:49,080
Leave none of Suowen's men alive.

187
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:51,279
Then no one

188
00:12:51,919 --> 00:12:53,600
will have proof we worked together.

189
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:54,840
Got it.

190
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:09,888
♪Dust rises along the border♪

191
00:13:09,930 --> 00:13:11,184
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

192
00:13:11,230 --> 00:13:12,384
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

193
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,920
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

194
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,344
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

195
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:16,432
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

196
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,968
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

197
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:19,296
♪My life is mine to bear♪

198
00:13:19,952 --> 00:13:22,360
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

199
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:25,184
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

200
00:13:25,260 --> 00:13:27,344
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

201
00:13:27,370 --> 00:13:28,832
♪My fate is mine to command♪

202
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:29,904
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

203
00:13:29,950 --> 00:13:31,248
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

204
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:32,608
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

205
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:33,952
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

206
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:35,344
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

207
00:13:35,370 --> 00:13:36,608
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

208
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:37,984
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

209
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,264
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

210
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,720
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

211
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:41,968
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

212
00:13:42,030 --> 00:13:43,168
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

213
00:13:43,210 --> 00:13:44,528
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

214
00:13:44,590 --> 00:13:46,928
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

215
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:51,328
♪With blood and sweat♪

216
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,752
♪I forge my glory♪

217
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:53,872
♪In this world of chaos♪

218
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,616
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

219
00:13:55,690 --> 00:13:56,752
♪My legend♪

220
00:13:56,816 --> 00:13:58,810
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

221
00:14:03,130 --> 00:14:05,408
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

222
00:14:05,580 --> 00:14:08,096
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

223
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:10,144
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

224
00:14:10,190 --> 00:14:11,680
♪My fate is mine to command♪

225
00:14:11,968 --> 00:14:13,680
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

226
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,576
♪My fate is mine to command♪

227
00:14:22,656 --> 00:14:24,650
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
